      "defect": "float-accum-delay-not-reset-per-vertex",
      "summary": "Each vertex job now re-arms accum_delay, the element counter and the accumulator restart flag, and a zero inverse out degree job no longer opens a drain window, so a result can no longer be published from a stale accumulator."
    },
    {
      "path": "03_capi_integration/accelerator_rtl/cu_control/cu_SPMV/CSR/PULL/FloatPoint/cu/cu_sum_kernel_control.sv",
