      "defect": "cc-update-lost-under-write-backpressure",
      "summary": "The hook forward stage is now unconditional and the completion branch no longer clears the in-flight hook or pulses an internal reset, so every generated component update reaches the write buffer exactly once; the element accounting no longer re-takes the continue count of the round that just finished, and a vertex job retires exactly once for the whole time it stays resident."
    },
