      "defect": "spmv-fixedpoint-accumulator-reused-as-triangle-kernel",
      "summary": "Replaced the copied SPMV FixedPoint accumulator with a real binary intersection counting kernel that declares cu_update_kernel_control, counts one triangle per sorted-neighbour comparison equality and publishes the per-vertex count."
